(6034335, 886458, 54645, '<td valign="top">Splendid. 10</td>', 'Splendid. 10', '2010-06-01 01:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034337, 887328, 54645, '<td valign="top">Textured drawing. Well done.</td>', 'Textured drawing. Well done.', '2010-06-01 01:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034338, 887322, 39057, '<td valign="top">Not sure how you got that old "worn" spotty look. Pretty good though..</td>', 'Not sure how you got that old "worn" spotty look. Pretty good though..', '2010-06-01 01:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034341, 886456, 54645, '<td valign="top">Soft like the music of cello. Excellent.</td>', 'Soft like the music of cello. Excellent.', '2010-06-01 01:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034344, 882068, 104841, '<td valign="top">while the colours look lovely together i think that you have overdone the purple/pink too much. Other then that it is quite a  nice shot.</td>', 'while the colours look lovely together i think that you have overdone the purple/pink too much. Other then that it is quite a  nice shot.', '2010-06-01 01:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034347, 884040, 54645, '<td valign="top">Such an intense gaze, dream or nightmare...6</td>', 'Such an intense gaze, dream or nightmare...6', '2010-06-01 01:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034348, 886449, 54645, '<td valign="top">gentle creature</td>', 'gentle creature', '2010-06-01 01:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034351, 886860, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice shot I think it looks rather good in mono. I think that the hair light might be too bright as it has washed out the back of her arm. The lighting on the face is just about perfect.</td>', 'nice shot I think it looks rather good in mono. I think that the hair light might be too bright as it has washed out the back of her arm. The lighting on the face is just about perfect.', '2010-06-01 01:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034352, 885473, 54645, '<td valign="top">I never get tire of seascapes. The bottom third really sells this scene for me.7</td>', 'I never get tire of seascapes. The bottom third really sells this scene for me.7', '2010-06-01 01:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034355, 881621, 54645, '<td valign="top">Intense start of the day.</td>', 'Intense start of the day.', '2010-06-01 01:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034356, 886548, 66515, '<td valign="top">Lots of potential in this image. A couple point however. The rocks in the middle of the picture seem soft for some reason. The ground in the foreground is a little too prevalent with really nothing there for the viewer to see. Reframing with more sky and less of the foreground land mass might work. <br/> <br/>That aside I am guessing this was a very appropriate and well executed use of HDR. (There is some haloing but that''s being nitpicky).</td>', 'Lots of potential in this image. A couple point however. The rocks in the middle of the picture seem soft for some reason. The ground in the foreground is a little too prevalent with really nothing there for the viewer to see. Reframing with more sky and less of the foreground land mass might work.  That aside I am guessing this was a very appropriate and well executed use of HDR. (There is some haloing but that''s being nitpicky).', '2010-06-01 01:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034358, 887460, 104841, '<td valign="top">while it is nice that you were able to fill the frame with the gull and get some feather detail I dont think it is the best angle to capture it from.</td>', 'while it is nice that you were able to fill the frame with the gull and get some feather detail I dont think it is the best angle to capture it from.', '2010-06-01 01:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034359, 879690, 39057, '<td valign="top">You from my town?</td>', 'You from my town?', '2010-06-01 01:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034363, 886340, 66515, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. The focus on the eyes is just a little off and it appears that the focus is actually on his nose. Great capture of his character and the exhaled smoke is an excellent touch. Well done.</td>', 'Great portrait. The focus on the eyes is just a little off and it appears that the focus is actually on his nose. Great capture of his character and the exhaled smoke is an excellent touch. Well done.', '2010-06-01 01:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034364, 887472, 104841, '<td valign="top">I dont mind the colour popping but I think you need to pay a little bit more attention to the edges as the don''t look quite right. Did you consider shooting it with a narrow DOF?</td>', 'I dont mind the colour popping but I think you need to pay a little bit more attention to the edges as the don''t look quite right. Did you consider shooting it with a narrow DOF?', '2010-06-01 01:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034366, 884143, 39057, '<td valign="top">I was there a year ago today....LOL....I couldn''t get a good pic though...good job.</td>', 'I was there a year ago today....LOL....I couldn''t get a good pic though...good job.', '2010-06-01 01:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034384, 886501, 17507, '<td valign="top">The sharpest part of the image is the nose. Since this is essentially a portrait, the facial features generally considered best to have in the sharpest focus are the eyes. I see no reason to have departed from this general rule here.</td>', 'The sharpest part of the image is the nose. Since this is essentially a portrait, the facial features generally considered best to have in the sharpest focus are the eyes. I see no reason to have departed from this general rule here.', '2010-06-01 01:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034386, 886717, 83313, '<td valign="top">Unusual treatment. I kind of like it, thought I expect it will not be to everyone''s tastes. I''ll be interested in seeing how this one ends up.</td>', 'Unusual treatment. I kind of like it, thought I expect it will not be to everyone''s tastes. I''ll be interested in seeing how this one ends up.', '2010-06-01 01:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034388, 887162, 17507, '<td valign="top">Fire is a very photogenic subject--however, what makes it really interesting is its details. Here, the flames are all completely blown out, and the resulting undetailed rings are a uniform and uncompelling white. Keeping the details would require a lower ISO or a smaller aperture.</td>', 'Fire is a very photogenic subject--however, what makes it really interesting is its details. Here, the flames are all completely blown out, and the resulting undetailed rings are a uniform and uncompelling white. Keeping the details would require a lower ISO or a smaller aperture.', '2010-06-01 01:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034389, 886287, 39057, '<td valign="top">I think I saw this girl before but could be wrong. This is very nice. You''re going to make this girl a model.</td>', 'I think I saw this girl before but could be wrong. This is very nice. You''re going to make this girl a model.', '2010-06-01 01:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034396, 887325, 60173, '<td valign="top">Wicked sky. This should do very well.</td>', 'Wicked sky. This should do very well.', '2010-06-01 01:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034405, 887301, 60173, '<td valign="top">The muted colors work well here. Very pretty scene.</td>', 'The muted colors work well here. Very pretty scene.', '2010-06-01 01:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034407, 886620, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m having a hard time with seeing exactly what the perspective is here. It looks like the bow of the boat, but it must be riding a wave or something, as this looks like a ridge it is perched on. Extra pointage for making me examine it more closely.</td>', 'I''m having a hard time with seeing exactly what the perspective is here. It looks like the bow of the boat, but it must be riding a wave or something, as this looks like a ridge it is perched on. Extra pointage for making me examine it more closely.', '2010-06-01 01:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034409, 882068, 83313, '<td valign="top">I liked a lot this until I got to the magenta sky. Sorry.</td>', 'I liked a lot this until I got to the magenta sky. Sorry.', '2010-06-01 01:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034410, 880101, 60173, '<td valign="top">Looks like an old postcard. That''s not a bad thing, I really like it.</td>', 'Looks like an old postcard. That''s not a bad thing, I really like it.', '2010-06-01 01:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034411, 887298, 54645, '<td valign="top">Gentle creature, odd use of a tire, I like it.</td>', 'Gentle creature, odd use of a tire, I like it.', '2010-06-01 01:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034421, 887177, 54645, '<td valign="top">answers anchored in REM. 9</td>', 'answers anchored in REM. 9', '2010-06-01 01:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034423, 886851, 17507, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The composition is great and the range of tones is strong. I don''t understand why the focus is so soft--could really use some USM at maybe 100%, 0.5 radius, 0 threshold.</td>', 'Beautiful. The composition is great and the range of tones is strong. I don''t understand why the focus is so soft--could really use some USM at maybe 100%, 0.5 radius, 0 threshold.', '2010-06-01 01:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034424, 884696, 54645, '<td valign="top">Sweet. I wish my baby was still this small! Congrats!</td>', 'Sweet. I wish my baby was still this small! Congrats!', '2010-06-01 01:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034425, 883231, 17507, '<td valign="top">This looks like a snapshot taken in the middle of the day, with little thought given to composition or a focal point.</td>', 'This looks like a snapshot taken in the middle of the day, with little thought given to composition or a focal point.', '2010-06-01 01:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034426, 886331, 60173, '<td valign="top">A square crop might have given this more impact. The silhouetted child on the shoulder is interesting.</td>', 'A square crop might have given this more impact. The silhouetted child on the shoulder is interesting.', '2010-06-01 01:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034428, 887433, 86447, '<td valign="top">Oh.  REALLY good.  I love this.  (not voting)</td>', 'Oh.  REALLY good.  I love this.  (not voting)', '2010-06-01 01:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034431, 887270, 17507, '<td valign="top">Great location for shooting. This would have been an excellent candidate for HDR processing. As it is, keeping the details in the shadows means you lost all the highlights in the water, resulting in several large unappealing white spots in your image.</td>', 'Great location for shooting. This would have been an excellent candidate for HDR processing. As it is, keeping the details in the shadows means you lost all the highlights in the water, resulting in several large unappealing white spots in your image.', '2010-06-01 01:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034434, 885795, 39057, '<td valign="top">Very nice expression.</td>', 'Very nice expression.', '2010-06-01 01:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034435, 886619, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, unnecessary title.</td>', 'Nice photo, unnecessary title.', '2010-06-01 01:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034436, 886782, 69325, '<td valign="top">hey man, did you mean to put this in the f/s? well either way it''s pretty cool!</td>', 'hey man, did you mean to put this in the f/s? well either way it''s pretty cool!', '2010-06-01 01:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034437, 886362, 17507, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. Great colors, tones, and depth of field. One thing strikes me as really strange, though: the title. Birds are a minor element in the photo. This is not a photo of birds.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. Great colors, tones, and depth of field. One thing strikes me as really strange, though: the title. Birds are a minor element in the photo. This is not a photo of birds.', '2010-06-01 01:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034438, 887171, 60173, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is surprisingly good. I went right past it initially, but came right back. I think my brain is programmed to see that shade of green and go, "yawn, another waterfall". This is anything but another waterfall shot.</td>', 'Wow, this is surprisingly good. I went right past it initially, but came right back. I think my brain is programmed to see that shade of green and go, "yawn, another waterfall". This is anything but another waterfall shot.', '2010-06-01 01:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034441, 887458, 17507, '<td valign="top">Beautiful choice of subject matter, but you''d need either better lighting or better post-processing, or both, to really make this photo striking. As it is, it looks washed out and flat.</td>', 'Beautiful choice of subject matter, but you''d need either better lighting or better post-processing, or both, to really make this photo striking. As it is, it looks washed out and flat.', '2010-06-01 01:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034442, 887326, 39057, '<td valign="top">Ducks and chickens don''t usually do well on DPC but I can''t see this getting less than a 6.3 or so.</td>', 'Ducks and chickens don''t usually do well on DPC but I can''t see this getting less than a 6.3 or so.', '2010-06-01 01:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034443, 887463, 17507, '<td valign="top">This looks like an outtake from the "Missed Focus" challenge--your primary subject is out of focus, but I cannot see how this helps the image.</td>', 'This looks like an outtake from the "Missed Focus" challenge--your primary subject is out of focus, but I cannot see how this helps the image.', '2010-06-01 01:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034457, 887412, 66515, '<td valign="top">Not really a fan of the processing to be honest. I understand you were trying to draw attention to his eyes but the effect is rather unsettling. Its a shame because I think you got perfect focus on the eyes and the exposure is right on. I''d be quite interested in seeing the original for comparison once voting closes.</td>', 'Not really a fan of the processing to be honest. I understand you were trying to draw attention to his eyes but the effect is rather unsettling. Its a shame because I think you got perfect focus on the eyes and the exposure is right on. I''d be quite interested in seeing the original for comparison once voting closes.', '2010-06-01 01:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034458, 881018, 91783, '<td valign="top">This looks great Jennifer! Hope you do well! Good luck!</td>', 'This looks great Jennifer! Hope you do well! Good luck!', '2010-06-01 01:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034462, 886287, 66515, '<td valign="top">Great exposure. I like the repeating pattern in the background as it helps draw the eye towards the model''s face. Nice bright colors without being oversaturated. Good lighting and you''ve managed to capture a great catch light in her eyes. Overall? "Supoib!"</td>', 'Great exposure. I like the repeating pattern in the background as it helps draw the eye towards the model''s face. Nice bright colors without being oversaturated. Good lighting and you''ve managed to capture a great catch light in her eyes. Overall? "Supoib!"', '2010-06-01 01:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034467, 883676, 18197, '<td valign="top">I hope you are an astronaut recently back from an STS Mission, in which case this photo is evidence of my tax dollars at work! I think I got my money''s worth but I would love to have an original res version of this ... it would be spectacular! Please!?!</td>', 'I hope you are an astronaut recently back from an STS Mission, in which case this photo is evidence of my tax dollars at work! I think I got my money''s worth but I would love to have an original res version of this ... it would be spectacular! Please!?!', '2010-06-01 01:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034469, 883676, 78445, '<td valign="top">Well done Robert didn''t believe it at first then i saw the report on you. 10</td>', 'Well done Robert didn''t believe it at first then i saw the report on you. 10', '2010-06-01 01:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034474, 879050, 91783, '<td valign="top">I like the concept a lot! But i feel as though she blends in a just a little bit. maybe its her outfit or the way you edited it, but imo she does. <br/> <br/>anyways. the lighting seems to be great, there are hardly, if any shadows, so that is great! and the clearity/sharpness is super! good luck!</td>', 'I like the concept a lot! But i feel as though she blends in a just a little bit. maybe its her outfit or the way you edited it, but imo she does.  anyways. the lighting seems to be great, there are hardly, if any shadows, so that is great! and the clearity/sharpness is super! good luck!', '2010-06-01 01:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6034480, 886234, 91783, '<td valign="top">there needs to be a building or person in this picture... i love the light and the mood that this scene gives. good luck!</td>', 'there needs to be a building or person in this picture... i love the light and the mood that this scene gives. good luck!', '2010-06-01 01:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
