(6034519, 886188, 5822, '<td valign="top">Has potential but technically has many issues. Blown highs, plugged and noisy shadows, cutoff limbs, disconnect between model and piano, DOF issues (I think you need more of it in the foreground at the piano. Just the back half is in focus). I like your choice of B&amp;W and the shinyness of the piano body.</td>', 'Has potential but technically has many issues. Blown highs, plugged and noisy shadows, cutoff limbs, disconnect between model and piano, DOF issues (I think you need more of it in the foreground at the piano. Just the back half is in focus). I like your choice of B&W and the shinyness of the piano body.', '2010-06-01 02:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
