(6034905, 886188, 104841, '<td valign="top">While I like your host I feel that the grain size that you have used here detracts from the shot. You have the smooth texture of the piano and a lovely young sophisticated women, so if you wanted to add grain I would have chosen a finer grain.</td>', 'While I like your host I feel that the grain size that you have used here detracts from the shot. You have the smooth texture of the piano and a lovely young sophisticated women, so if you wanted to add grain I would have chosen a finer grain.', '2010-06-01 10:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
