(6034986, 886831, 99263, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like this style of processing and the wonderful fine detail. I hope you will add details of your work flow for this image to the "Photographers comments" box as I will be looking for it after the voting ends. Or if you like you could send me a private message explaining your editing and work flow and the camera, lens, aperture used. I would really appreciate it. I have already voted (I gave you a 9) and won''t change my score so feel free to send me the details. <br/>Regards<br/>Fred</td>', 'Very nice. I like this style of processing and the wonderful fine detail. I hope you will add details of your work flow for this image to the "Photographers comments" box as I will be looking for it after the voting ends. Or if you like you could send me a private message explaining your editing and work flow and the camera, lens, aperture used. I would really appreciate it. I have already voted (I gave you a 9) and won''t change my score so feel free to send me the details. RegardsFred', '2010-06-01 11:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
