(6035044, 887362, 60495, '<td valign="top">When I look at this image the first thing I see is the black line in the middle which really ruins the shot for me, overall I like the tones and thing the scene would have been interesting without the line. 5</td>', 'When I look at this image the first thing I see is the black line in the middle which really ruins the shot for me, overall I like the tones and thing the scene would have been interesting without the line. 5', '2010-06-01 12:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6035048, 884431, 60495, '<td valign="top">This shot just really does not work for me, IMO the image is very busy and does not really have great tones and colors to help carry the busyness of the image. Looks like the image was taken mid day which is not a great time to be taking this type of shot and the evergreens are really dark in comparison to the other trees. Finding aspen groves that do not have evergreens mixed in really helps and time of day is always key. Hope the info helps, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This shot just really does not work for me, IMO the image is very busy and does not really have great tones and colors to help carry the busyness of the image. Looks like the image was taken mid day which is not a great time to be taking this type of shot and the evergreens are really dark in comparison to the other trees. Finding aspen groves that do not have evergreens mixed in really helps and time of day is always key. Hope the info helps, good luck in the challenge.', '2010-06-01 12:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
