(6035197, 887200, 83313, '<td valign="top">Watch your JPEG compression levels when you save. I see some obvious compression artifacts around her shoulder and a general loss of detail, which could have been easily avoided. You had more than 200K of file size overhead, so you could have used a lot less compression. Otherwise, a cute pic.</td>', 'Watch your JPEG compression levels when you save. I see some obvious compression artifacts around her shoulder and a general loss of detail, which could have been easily avoided. You had more than 200K of file size overhead, so you could have used a lot less compression. Otherwise, a cute pic.', '2010-06-01 14:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
