(6035705, 884725, 39057, '<td valign="top">I like this but it lacks contrast with the sky. It does look like you used a light source under the daisy and that is good. Someone taught me a photoshop trick when I was editing my current free study entry...<br/> <br/>...it was to create a layer and used "soft light" as the layer property. It really adds and makes the subject pop out from the background.<br/> <br/>I''ll go ahead and give this a 6. I base my score on the lighting used under the daisy and the fact that I can make out each petal against the sky background.</td>', 'I like this but it lacks contrast with the sky. It does look like you used a light source under the daisy and that is good. Someone taught me a photoshop trick when I was editing my current free study entry... ...it was to create a layer and used "soft light" as the layer property. It really adds and makes the subject pop out from the background. I''ll go ahead and give this a 6. I base my score on the lighting used under the daisy and the fact that I can make out each petal against the sky background.', '2010-06-01 19:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
