(6035817, 886834, 39057, '<td valign="top">Great color and levels on this photo. I wish I could give a 7 but the composition is awkward. At first I didn''t know what I was looking at. I see now that it is two lions. 6</td>', 'Great color and levels on this photo. I wish I could give a 7 but the composition is awkward. At first I didn''t know what I was looking at. I see now that it is two lions. 6', '2010-06-01 20:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
