(6035844, 886331, 43463, '<td valign="top">O.K. a slightly above average shot of a .....whoa! You have a great eye to have spotted this photo opportunity! Love the parallels here: human and ape. I do think that you could have gotten away with calling this "Profiles" - just to offer another hint to those who would quickly pass this by without noticing the little visual gem you have here. Love that you caught the two profiles looking away from each other for that also adds visual interest; two species, two paths. The gorilla also has an facial expression that makes me think he/she is listening to some inner music or meditative state (perhaps reflecting upon inner being/spirit perhaps). This photo could hold many different meanings.</td>', 'O.K. a slightly above average shot of a .....whoa! You have a great eye to have spotted this photo opportunity! Love the parallels here: human and ape. I do think that you could have gotten away with calling this "Profiles" - just to offer another hint to those who would quickly pass this by without noticing the little visual gem you have here. Love that you caught the two profiles looking away from each other for that also adds visual interest; two species, two paths. The gorilla also has an facial expression that makes me think he/she is listening to some inner music or meditative state (perhaps reflecting upon inner being/spirit perhaps). This photo could hold many different meanings.', '2010-06-01 21:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6035938, 887034, 39057, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Expression and colors are great. Something about the blur on her head and right arm doesn''t seem right. It just doesn''t look like a natural camera blur. However, I give it a 6.</td>', 'Very nice. Expression and colors are great. Something about the blur on her head and right arm doesn''t seem right. It just doesn''t look like a natural camera blur. However, I give it a 6.', '2010-06-01 22:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6035946, 886450, 39057, '<td valign="top">I hope this is real! I''m giving a 7. Many DPC voters seem to dislike birds, ducks, geese...etc....My guess is this will avg about 6.1.</td>', 'I hope this is real! I''m giving a 7. Many DPC voters seem to dislike birds, ducks, geese...etc....My guess is this will avg about 6.1.', '2010-06-01 22:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
