(6037738, 887260, 17507, '<td valign="top">Awesome silhouettes, interesting negative space, great colors. It''s hard to pull off a baby pic that isn''t painfully trite and/or adorable only to the parents and the viewers who also happen to be mothers, but you''ve done it here. The photo is very cramped on the left and right, though--it would be much stronger if the figures had some room to breathe. (7)</td>', 'Awesome silhouettes, interesting negative space, great colors. It''s hard to pull off a baby pic that isn''t painfully trite and/or adorable only to the parents and the viewers who also happen to be mothers, but you''ve done it here. The photo is very cramped on the left and right, though--it would be much stronger if the figures had some room to breathe. (7)', '2010-06-02 14:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037742, 887470, 17507, '<td valign="top">Ha! A double pun! Love it.</td>', 'Ha! A double pun! Love it.', '2010-06-02 14:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037745, 886884, 17507, '<td valign="top">Hey, I know just where this is taken from! Great composition, good processing, and nice job getting one of the more interesting SF skies. Parts of the span where the cables meet the roadway look a little bit fuzzy--otherwise very solid.</td>', 'Hey, I know just where this is taken from! Great composition, good processing, and nice job getting one of the more interesting SF skies. Parts of the span where the cables meet the roadway look a little bit fuzzy--otherwise very solid.', '2010-06-02 14:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037750, 887389, 17507, '<td valign="top">Nice summery shot. Would have been awesome for Missed Focus!</td>', 'Nice summery shot. Would have been awesome for Missed Focus!', '2010-06-02 14:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037753, 887410, 17507, '<td valign="top">Awesome... reminds me somewhat of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=32997" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bucket</a>''s "Heartbeat of Trees," which, if you aren''t familiar with already, you should go check out</td>', 'Awesome... reminds me somewhat of  bucket''s "Heartbeat of Trees," which, if you aren''t familiar with already, you should go check out', '2010-06-02 14:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
