(6038012, 885795, 112972, '<td valign="top">A perfect 10 picture.  The title says it all.  Love the smile, love how the hair is flowing in the wind, love the hat, love the background, love the shallow DoF, and last but not least, love your choice of processing.</td>', 'A perfect 10 picture.  The title says it all.  Love the smile, love how the hair is flowing in the wind, love the hat, love the background, love the shallow DoF, and last but not least, love your choice of processing.', '2010-06-02 18:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
