(6038445, 886727, 77196, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the OOF pot in the foreground that due to selective desat is the focal point of the picture.</td>', 'Don''t like the OOF pot in the foreground that due to selective desat is the focal point of the picture.', '2010-06-02 23:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038447, 886851, 77196, '<td valign="top">Too bad the mid-range mountain is in cloud shadow. This must be amazing to see in person - I''m sure pictures just don''t do it justice.</td>', 'Too bad the mid-range mountain is in cloud shadow. This must be amazing to see in person - I''m sure pictures just don''t do it justice.', '2010-06-02 23:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038459, 885551, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice exposure on bird. Unfortunately, the blown out leaves then distract from the picture. A bit tighter crop (bring in right to just right of the center leaf sprout, and bottom to just above down-hanging sprout topmost leaves) could reduce the problem without detracting from your main subject.</td>', 'Very nice exposure on bird. Unfortunately, the blown out leaves then distract from the picture. A bit tighter crop (bring in right to just right of the center leaf sprout, and bottom to just above down-hanging sprout topmost leaves) could reduce the problem without detracting from your main subject.', '2010-06-02 23:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038473, 886523, 77196, '<td valign="top">Fascinating photo - wonder how you did this. Unfortunately, the technicals kill this shot. Her face is in shadow, she''s looking away from the camera, and it doesn''t look like anything is in focus. A deep DOF would have helped a lot.</td>', 'Fascinating photo - wonder how you did this. Unfortunately, the technicals kill this shot. Her face is in shadow, she''s looking away from the camera, and it doesn''t look like anything is in focus. A deep DOF would have helped a lot.', '2010-06-02 23:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038475, 886571, 77196, '<td valign="top">Too much dark in the bottom 1/2 of the shot.</td>', 'Too much dark in the bottom 1/2 of the shot.', '2010-06-02 23:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038479, 887133, 77196, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors! Great exposure! 10</td>', 'Stunning colors! Great exposure! 10', '2010-06-02 23:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038481, 887447, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.</td>', 'Very nice lighting.', '2010-06-02 23:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038483, 880774, 108069, '<td valign="top">Easy for you to say! I live to the east! Excellent shot.</td>', 'Easy for you to say! I live to the east! Excellent shot.', '2010-06-02 23:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038493, 879353, 77196, '<td valign="top">For a shot like this, the dog *has* to be in focus. The blue collar detracts from the dog. The very light blanket in the foreground distracts. Lots of patterns and textures in the picture that don''t work together. A tighter crop would have reduced the distractions. Looks like a wonderful dog. Is he on your spot on the couch? Looks like something he would do...</td>', 'For a shot like this, the dog *has* to be in focus. The blue collar detracts from the dog. The very light blanket in the foreground distracts. Lots of patterns and textures in the picture that don''t work together. A tighter crop would have reduced the distractions. Looks like a wonderful dog. Is he on your spot on the couch? Looks like something he would do...', '2010-06-02 23:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038498, 883961, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice. What makes this picture pop for me are two major factors - she''s looking directly at the camera and engages the viewer immediately. The flyaway strand of hair adds a sense of transience and intrigue. Excellent lighting.</td>', 'Very, very nice. What makes this picture pop for me are two major factors - she''s looking directly at the camera and engages the viewer immediately. The flyaway strand of hair adds a sense of transience and intrigue. Excellent lighting.', '2010-06-02 23:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038501, 886674, 77196, '<td valign="top">The sense of fun comes across. Excellent colors!</td>', 'The sense of fun comes across. Excellent colors!', '2010-06-02 23:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038504, 886362, 77196, '<td valign="top">Cliff. Ocean. Great sky.</td>', 'Cliff. Ocean. Great sky.', '2010-06-02 23:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038508, 887455, 77196, '<td valign="top">Image has a split personality. Pick a subject - sailboat or surfer - they''re not close enough to work. Also, both appear OOF - focus appears to be on the ocean floor in the foreground.</td>', 'Image has a split personality. Pick a subject - sailboat or surfer - they''re not close enough to work. Also, both appear OOF - focus appears to be on the ocean floor in the foreground.', '2010-06-02 23:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
