(6038922, 884040, 112828, '<td valign="top">What did you smoke before bed?<br/> <br/>As a high-key image I guess this works pretty well... Have I ever mentioned that I rarely appreciate high-key images??<br/> <br/>So, I''m on a campaign of appreciation, I''m trying to really vote based on merit, regardless of my taste (well, maybe a bit of a bonus for aesthetics...).. In any case, last week you would have gotten a 3 for this, maybe a 2..  This week?  hmm..  So hard.  I guess it''s nice for what you were trying to do, and it''s not overall displeasing.. So...  I guess I''ll be generous, as I''m sure many others won''t be.... You get a 7 on this.  <br/> <br/>As a side note, have you looked into the printing on aluminum?  They say it''s best with high-key images, and since you''re dreaming about horses, clearly you love them, so this image might be a nice print on aluminum...</td>', 'What did you smoke before bed? As a high-key image I guess this works pretty well... Have I ever mentioned that I rarely appreciate high-key images?? So, I''m on a campaign of appreciation, I''m trying to really vote based on merit, regardless of my taste (well, maybe a bit of a bonus for aesthetics...).. In any case, last week you would have gotten a 3 for this, maybe a 2..  This week?  hmm..  So hard.  I guess it''s nice for what you were trying to do, and it''s not overall displeasing.. So...  I guess I''ll be generous, as I''m sure many others won''t be.... You get a 7 on this.   As a side note, have you looked into the printing on aluminum?  They say it''s best with high-key images, and since you''re dreaming about horses, clearly you love them, so this image might be a nice print on aluminum...', '2010-06-03 05:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
