(6041360, 885543, 40391, '<td valign="top">I hope the squirrel escaped ;)<br/>If you get the chance to take another shot like this try and reduce the depth of field to blur out some of the background to take away some of the distraction from your subject. 4.</td>', 'I hope the squirrel escaped ;)If you get the chance to take another shot like this try and reduce the depth of field to blur out some of the background to take away some of the distraction from your subject. 4.', '2010-06-04 22:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
