(6041423, 883689, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cocktail? This bird can make mixed drinks? Now that''s talent! (Sorry ''bout that, but if you make a spelling error, I feel obliged to take advantage of it.)</td>', 'Cocktail? This bird can make mixed drinks? Now that''s talent! (Sorry ''bout that, but if you make a spelling error, I feel obliged to take advantage of it.)', '2010-06-04 23:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
