(6041442, 886690, 83313, '<td valign="top">Midday sun kills an otherwise good shot. Not anything you had a lot of control over. Might be some PP tricks you could do to help bring out some of that shadow detail, though. I also find midday sun shots are often helped if I do them as a b/w.</td>', 'Midday sun kills an otherwise good shot. Not anything you had a lot of control over. Might be some PP tricks you could do to help bring out some of that shadow detail, though. I also find midday sun shots are often helped if I do them as a b/w.', '2010-06-04 23:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
