(6041585, 887289, 112828, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=104650" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ronaldfw</a>, I''m going to forever associate this scene with you...  If I''m wrong I''ll eat my words, but since you''ve shown a serious propensity for this location, I''ll bet it''s you! :)..<br/> <br/>This is, if it is you, one of your best shots of this location, and I really like the depth of the water (a polarizer might have helped...)..<br/> <br/>The image is a touch soft, but-- overall, this is a very, very cool image, you get an 8 today. :)</td>', ' ronaldfw, I''m going to forever associate this scene with you...  If I''m wrong I''ll eat my words, but since you''ve shown a serious propensity for this location, I''ll bet it''s you! :).. This is, if it is you, one of your best shots of this location, and I really like the depth of the water (a polarizer might have helped...).. The image is a touch soft, but-- overall, this is a very, very cool image, you get an 8 today. :)', '2010-06-05 01:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6041588, 886844, 112828, '<td valign="top">Ha, I so had to go back to the user portrait challenge...<br/> <br/>A superb image karenk, and sfmorris, you look just wonderful here.<br/> <br/>I prefer this over the user portrait version.. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=879990" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1209/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_879990.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1209/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_879990.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1209/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_879990.jpg"/></a> as this is a touch sharper, and I like what the B&amp;W treatment did for it..<br/> <br/>Hmm, 7 or 8, 7 or 8...  ..  Ok fine, 8..  Nice image..  Really nice.</td>', 'Ha, I so had to go back to the user portrait challenge... A superb image karenk, and sfmorris, you look just wonderful here. I prefer this over the user portrait version..  as this is a touch sharper, and I like what the B&W treatment did for it.. Hmm, 7 or 8, 7 or 8...  ..  Ok fine, 8..  Nice image..  Really nice.', '2010-06-05 01:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6041589, 887421, 112828, '<td valign="top">Zoomdak and Haystack..  Yeah, I''m voting generously- you''re getting an 8, if only for continuing to shoehorn this thing into every challenge you can (I think it''s very pretty, and don''t blame you a bit.. Unlike those genuinely horrible recurring shoehorns..)..  Ok 8.. Yeah.  Nice image - Oh I like the rays extending into the shadow from the sun..</td>', 'Zoomdak and Haystack..  Yeah, I''m voting generously- you''re getting an 8, if only for continuing to shoehorn this thing into every challenge you can (I think it''s very pretty, and don''t blame you a bit.. Unlike those genuinely horrible recurring shoehorns..)..  Ok 8.. Yeah.  Nice image - Oh I like the rays extending into the shadow from the sun..', '2010-06-05 01:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6041590, 886727, 112828, '<td valign="top">An appropriate Memorial Day image.. 8</td>', 'An appropriate Memorial Day image.. 8', '2010-06-05 01:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6041591, 887130, 112828, '<td valign="top">A very interesting image..  I think the tone mapping and/or structuring was a bit heavy handed, as there seems to be some haloing going on..  But---  Looking past that, this is a fun, very cool perspective shot, his expression is great, and the crew sitting along side the aircraft adds to the photo.  I''m guessing this was a candid, but damn, I would believe it was a photo-shoot.  Well done overall, you get an 8, not for image quality (the halos kill me), but for such a nice story.</td>', 'A very interesting image..  I think the tone mapping and/or structuring was a bit heavy handed, as there seems to be some haloing going on..  But---  Looking past that, this is a fun, very cool perspective shot, his expression is great, and the crew sitting along side the aircraft adds to the photo.  I''m guessing this was a candid, but damn, I would believe it was a photo-shoot.  Well done overall, you get an 8, not for image quality (the halos kill me), but for such a nice story.', '2010-06-05 01:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
