(6041648, 878959, 509, '<td valign="top">A familiar feeling (though I usually play the part of the one in the background = P  )<br/>I''d like to see a different composition for the bird in the foreground.  The background picture fills in the frame nicely, but the centered composition of the foreground peacock is a little bit drab imho.  I''m not sure how I''d recompose this, but would just suggest taking several pictures at different angles and positionings of the two subjects to see what works best.</td>', 'A familiar feeling (though I usually play the part of the one in the background = P  )I''d like to see a different composition for the bird in the foreground.  The background picture fills in the frame nicely, but the centered composition of the foreground peacock is a little bit drab imho.  I''m not sure how I''d recompose this, but would just suggest taking several pictures at different angles and positionings of the two subjects to see what works best.', '2010-06-05 04:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
