(6041765, 885543, 101668, '<td valign="top">I am a dog lover but lets face it, few dogs are reallly photogenic. If the background was bokeh this would have been a lot better too. It seems as if very little or no processing was done which does not help either. A beautiful dog and for that a 5</td>', 'I am a dog lover but lets face it, few dogs are reallly photogenic. If the background was bokeh this would have been a lot better too. It seems as if very little or no processing was done which does not help either. A beautiful dog and for that a 5', '2010-06-05 10:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
