(6042273, 886900, 15407, '<td valign="top">The out of focus flowers distractfor me. Perhaps if you trimmed off the other flowers they would no have distracted from the very nice flower to become the subject of the photo.</td>', 'The out of focus flowers distractfor me. Perhaps if you trimmed off the other flowers they would no have distracted from the very nice flower to become the subject of the photo.', '2010-06-05 20:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
