(6042290, 886473, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting semi-abstract perspective. I like the way that you''ve gotten a unique view of something that''s been photographed to death from a more common angle.</td>', 'An interesting semi-abstract perspective. I like the way that you''ve gotten a unique view of something that''s been photographed to death from a more common angle.', '2010-06-05 20:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
