(6042295, 886566, 83313, '<td valign="top">Really interesting street photography. From the children''s curiosity, to the detail of the brides shoes and sneakers visible from under her dress. Great catch of a unique slice of life. I think I am faving this one.</td>', 'Really interesting street photography. From the children''s curiosity, to the detail of the brides shoes and sneakers visible from under her dress. Great catch of a unique slice of life. I think I am faving this one.', '2010-06-05 20:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
