(6046011, 887419, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ouch. Somehow, I thought this was your entry. Well, at least I explained my low vote. (It was a 4) Hope it was helpful.</td>', 'Ouch. Somehow, I thought this was your entry. Well, at least I explained my low vote. (It was a 4) Hope it was helpful.', '2010-06-08 01:24:40.000000', NULL, 0),
