(6046014, 877732, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wow, no comments during voting. You get this special ribbon <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=410590" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30982/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_410590.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30982/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_410590.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30982/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_410590.gif"/></a> to use on your profile page, if you want it.<br/> <br/>I like your photo a lot, the b&amp;w conversion is very nice, and I think the use of partial color is perfect for this. Without it, the boy could have blended into the background. I like the curve of the bridge with its lines leading right to the focal point. And there is a lot of nostalgia in the shot. Really very nice. It''s the sort of image that asks you to stop and stay awhile -- unfortunately voters here don''t do that.</td>', 'Wow, no comments during voting. You get this special ribbon  to use on your profile page, if you want it. I like your photo a lot, the b&w conversion is very nice, and I think the use of partial color is perfect for this. Without it, the boy could have blended into the background. I like the curve of the bridge with its lines leading right to the focal point. And there is a lot of nostalgia in the shot. Really very nice. It''s the sort of image that asks you to stop and stay awhile -- unfortunately voters here don''t do that.', '2010-06-08 01:25:04.000000', NULL, 0),
