(6046068, 885279, 25355, '<td valign="top">I guess this scored so well because of the quality of the jewels rather than the pose of the spider. ;-) <br/>  Congrats on the <strike>yellow</strike> red ribbon, Doc.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-06-08 09:01:09.</i></td>', 'I guess this scored so well because of the quality of the jewels rather than the pose of the spider. ;-)   Congrats on the yellow red ribbon, Doc.', '2010-06-08 01:52:17.000000', '2010-06-08 10:01:09.000000', 0),
(6046069, 886331, 54563, '<td valign="top">thank you all for the comments, for my first submission in really so long I appreciate it a lot and thank you to for the posthumous blue :)  I love it! I have to figure out how to get it in the profile section.<br/> <br/>I was trying to get an image using the reflections to show the parallels I think C. Novack described it quite like I see it as well.  bravo :)</td>', 'thank you all for the comments, for my first submission in really so long I appreciate it a lot and thank you to for the posthumous blue :)  I love it! I have to figure out how to get it in the profile section. I was trying to get an image using the reflections to show the parallels I think C. Novack described it quite like I see it as well.  bravo :)', '2010-06-08 01:52:27.000000', NULL, 0),
