(6046081, 887362, 68504, '<td valign="top">my god a war zone.  even the little kid has a rifle. what will be revealed when the smoke clears. whose flag at the end of the alley.  no, clearly none of this is the case, but it sure makes you feel it, and then you begin to wonder if this isn''t more mysterious.</td>', 'my god a war zone.  even the little kid has a rifle. what will be revealed when the smoke clears. whose flag at the end of the alley.  no, clearly none of this is the case, but it sure makes you feel it, and then you begin to wonder if this isn''t more mysterious.', '2010-06-08 02:02:01.000000', NULL, 0),
