(6046083, 883223, 110400, '<td valign="top">I have to say that I am EXTREMELY disappointed that this one didn''t do a lot better.  The week started off with a high 7 and held for about 24 hours before being dragged down sub-six. Too bad I was a week off for the HDR challenge as I think I put up 2 very good HDR images for the 2 challenges the week before it came out.  I really expected this one to do better and it amazes me that anyone would vote this with anything less than a 5.  To get 3 2s and 2 3s and 12 4s is really a testament to how people must really be jaded on this site.  And to think the 5.5 should be considered average as the midpoint between the bottom of the scale and the top.<br/> <br/>For Prism, I have placed the 5 images I used to make up this picture below.  The 2nd one is probably what it closest to an original if I hadn''t HDR''d it and added the post processing.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=889504" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889504.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889504.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889504.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=889505" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889505.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889505.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889505.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=889506" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889506.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889506.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889506.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=889507" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889507.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889507.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889507.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=889508" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889508.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889508.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889508.jpg"/></a> <br/></td>', 'I have to say that I am EXTREMELY disappointed that this one didn''t do a lot better.  The week started off with a high 7 and held for about 24 hours before being dragged down sub-six. Too bad I was a week off for the HDR challenge as I think I put up 2 very good HDR images for the 2 challenges the week before it came out.  I really expected this one to do better and it amazes me that anyone would vote this with anything less than a 5.  To get 3 2s and 2 3s and 12 4s is really a testament to how people must really be jaded on this site.  And to think the 5.5 should be considered average as the midpoint between the bottom of the scale and the top. For Prism, I have placed the 5 images I used to make up this picture below.  The 2nd one is probably what it closest to an original if I hadn''t HDR''d it and added the post processing.      ', '2010-06-08 02:03:33.000000', NULL, 0),
