(6046471, 887230, 92027, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comments all!<br/> <br/>This is one of my last shots from the world wide beloved volcano Eyjafjallajökull in Iceland, which erupted from April 14 to May 23. As the volcano beeing cooling down, it''s good news for traveling by air, so if you''re interested in brand new landscape, this is the change. Anyway, it''s pretty hard to go back to "ordinary" landscape shots after these two months of adventures around the volcanoes in Iceland. <br/> <br/>Cheers, Skarpi<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-06-08 11:30:01.</i></td>', 'Thanks for your comments all! This is one of my last shots from the world wide beloved volcano Eyjafjallajökull in Iceland, which erupted from April 14 to May 23. As the volcano beeing cooling down, it''s good news for traveling by air, so if you''re interested in brand new landscape, this is the change. Anyway, it''s pretty hard to go back to "ordinary" landscape shots after these two months of adventures around the volcanoes in Iceland.  Cheers, Skarpi', '2010-06-08 12:29:19.000000', '2010-06-08 12:30:01.000000', 0),
