(6046526, 885407, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nutzito:</b></div><hr/><i> Huge congrats on the ribbon!!!</i></td></tr></table> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> Brilliant capture.  Brilliant processing.   Lovely ribbon. </i></td></tr></table> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jutilda:</b></div><hr/><i> Oops, I forgot this was yours.  Oh well.  I gave it an 8 because it deserved it, not because you are a team member. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I guess I am missing something here :). Two people congratulated me on a ribbon, and you said you gave me 8 NOT because I am a team member... hmm... Judy, I would love us to be teammates, but last I checked we weren''t... and I would love to win a ribbon with this, but last I checked I didn''t... LOL<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-06-08 14:46:49.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by nutzito: Huge congrats on the ribbon!!! Originally posted by LydiaToo: Brilliant capture.  Brilliant processing.   Lovely ribbon.  Originally posted by Jutilda: Oops, I forgot this was yours.  Oh well.  I gave it an 8 because it deserved it, not because you are a team member.  I guess I am missing something here :). Two people congratulated me on a ribbon, and you said you gave me 8 NOT because I am a team member... hmm... Judy, I would love us to be teammates, but last I checked we weren''t... and I would love to win a ribbon with this, but last I checked I didn''t... LOL', '2010-06-08 13:24:07.000000', '2010-06-08 15:46:49.000000', 0),
