(6046678, 884629, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmy!  What beautiful fine art! And I am so impressed and delighted that it won 7th place in a free study.  In the past, artistic blur has been hard to sell with this crowd.  It just goes to show how fabulous it is!  Congratulations!</td>', 'Ohmy!  What beautiful fine art! And I am so impressed and delighted that it won 7th place in a free study.  In the past, artistic blur has been hard to sell with this crowd.  It just goes to show how fabulous it is!  Congratulations!', '2010-06-08 15:46:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6046679, 887466, 108525, '<td valign="top">I really dont know why this photo didnt score into the 6''s.  It is really a great shot!  I was expecting it to place in the top 20-30.</td>', 'I really dont know why this photo didnt score into the 6''s.  It is really a great shot!  I was expecting it to place in the top 20-30.', '2010-06-08 15:46:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6046680, 883961, 24454, '<td valign="top">Yayyy!  Congratulations, Jason!  This is bar none your best portrait yet -- And you can definitely see the influence of your amazing mentor  :)  I totally love this!</td>', 'Yayyy!  Congratulations, Jason!  This is bar none your best portrait yet -- And you can definitely see the influence of your amazing mentor  :)  I totally love this!', '2010-06-08 15:47:33.000000', NULL, 0),
