(6046913, 883961, 67145, '<td valign="top">CONGRATS JASON .. fantastic to see you and sofia on the front page .. <br/>i love the pose, i love her look, i love your b&amp;w and composition .. this portrait has that certain something that makes it very special ... way to go mate .. !!..;)</td>', 'CONGRATS JASON .. fantastic to see you and sofia on the front page .. i love the pose, i love her look, i love your b&w and composition .. this portrait has that certain something that makes it very special ... way to go mate .. !!..;)', '2010-06-08 18:23:21.000000', NULL, 0),
