(6046949, 885279, 76712, '<td valign="top">I like this alot, its unusal for a freestudy and thats why i love it, theres always too many landsacpes and such that win free studys :) Well done.</td>', 'I like this alot, its unusal for a freestudy and thats why i love it, theres always too many landsacpes and such that win free studys :) Well done.', '2010-06-08 18:47:05.000000', NULL, 0),
