(6047468, 885279, 69325, '<td valign="top">Congrats Doc! Nice to see a Jason in the winners circle ;) I think the refractions in the water drops are almost as cool as the shot itself</td>', 'Congrats Doc! Nice to see a Jason in the winners circle ;) I think the refractions in the water drops are almost as cool as the shot itself', '2010-06-09 00:41:18.000000', NULL, 0),
