(6047830, 887214, 40391, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Abra:</b></div><hr/><i> This is very well captured. I''m guessing done with HDR? If so, excellent job. If not, still an excellent job. 8. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m surprised this didn''t finish higher. I''m a little curious as why you considered all the other comments you got were helpful but mine. If you get the chance please let me know. I didn''t comment on all shots but this one I felt this one was worth the effort.</td>', 'Originally posted by Abra: This is very well captured. I''m guessing done with HDR? If so, excellent job. If not, still an excellent job. 8.   I''m surprised this didn''t finish higher. I''m a little curious as why you considered all the other comments you got were helpful but mine. If you get the chance please let me know. I didn''t comment on all shots but this one I felt this one was worth the effort.', '2010-06-09 05:10:33.000000', NULL, 0),
