(6048157, 882068, 61961, '<td valign="top">A bit over the top, but striking.  I prefer the subtler sky in your alternate version, but I like the sea in the version you submitted -- not so much the blue color, but the whitecaps really pop.  The "lady" in the photo is too small to see at this size.  I wonder if a closer crop would have helped emphasize her without losing the interesting details of the environment?</td>', 'A bit over the top, but striking.  I prefer the subtler sky in your alternate version, but I like the sea in the version you submitted -- not so much the blue color, but the whitecaps really pop.  The "lady" in the photo is too small to see at this size.  I wonder if a closer crop would have helped emphasize her without losing the interesting details of the environment?', '2010-06-09 10:46:56.000000', NULL, 0),
