(6053587, 879690, 47974, '<td valign="top">For those that were wondering.  This was taken at the Houston Zoo.  The trainer had the bird out and was talking to us about her.  There was a dull green building behind the bird (have some shots with that background and maybe I should have entered one of them) but I noticed this bright green metal bar could be used as the background.  I like the green background but I can understand how others would not.</td>', 'For those that were wondering.  This was taken at the Houston Zoo.  The trainer had the bird out and was talking to us about her.  There was a dull green building behind the bird (have some shots with that background and maybe I should have entered one of them) but I noticed this bright green metal bar could be used as the background.  I like the green background but I can understand how others would not.', '2010-06-13 17:33:55.000000', NULL, 0),
