(6102985, 887326, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and amount of details I can see here. Look at the texture in the feathers, the coxcomb and the wooden post! Wow! Colors and clarity are wonderful. This is a great slice of life photo of the farm-life/country. Nicely done - even the cropping is perfect for it complements the Rooster without calling attention/focus away.</td>', 'Love the colors and amount of details I can see here. Look at the texture in the feathers, the coxcomb and the wooden post! Wow! Colors and clarity are wonderful. This is a great slice of life photo of the farm-life/country. Nicely done - even the cropping is perfect for it complements the Rooster without calling attention/focus away.', '2010-07-24 21:45:31.000000', NULL, 0),
