(6949564, 887130, 140305, '<td valign="top">I love this one. I especially like the perspective of the pilot in relation to the jet. I live near Cold Lake, Alberta and I once got to take a tour of the AF base there. Actually got to sit in an F-18 cockpit. Very cool although I can''t imagine how a big guy can be comfortable in one of those.</td>', 'I love this one. I especially like the perspective of the pilot in relation to the jet. I live near Cold Lake, Alberta and I once got to take a tour of the AF base there. Actually got to sit in an F-18 cockpit. Very cool although I can''t imagine how a big guy can be comfortable in one of those.', '2013-01-05 12:12:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6949587, 887130, 96751, '<td valign="top">This was the shot that put you on my map. I was blown away by it, by the use of the wide angle in an intimate portrait, by the inclusion of the plane and the incredible sky. I only just now realized that there are two other people in the image.</td>', 'This was the shot that put you on my map. I was blown away by it, by the use of the wide angle in an intimate portrait, by the inclusion of the plane and the incredible sky. I only just now realized that there are two other people in the image.', '2013-01-05 12:23:56.000000', NULL, 0),
